<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it has launched 50 million American style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$50.363    PREMIUM	 7.78 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.35	GEARING	 4.39X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 10.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$59.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
